        "name": "Bladecaller",
        "summary": "Xayah calls back all her dropped Feathers dealing damage and rooting enemies.",
        "bodyHtml": "Xayah calls all <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Feathers</span> back to her, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(50/65/80/95/110 + (40% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> each. If 3 or more <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Feathers</span> hit an enemy, they are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Rooted</span> for 1.25 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Damage scales with Critical Strike Chance and Critical Strike Damage at <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">50%</span> effectiveness.<br />Minions take 50% damage from this Ability.<br />Enemies take 5% less damage per feather hit, to a minimum of 10% damage.</span>",
