        "bodyHtml": "Xayah leaps into the air becoming Untargetable and Ghosted for 1.5 seconds before raining down daggers that deal <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(200/300/400 + (100% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and leave behind a line of <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Feathers</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Untargetable units won't be affected by enemy Attacks or Abilities unless they've already been affected by them.<br />Ghosted units ignore collision with other units.<br />Xayah can move while in the air.</span>",
